Show how arguments arrive in main.

A second paragraph of help.

Usage: ok cli_help.ok <input> [count] [extra...] [--out <path>] [--ratio <float>] [--wait <duration>] [--tag <value>] [--verbose] [--no-color] [--label <value>] [--dry-run]

Arguments:
  <input>            the file to read
  [count]            how many [default: 3]
  [extra...]         anything else

Options:
  --out <path>       where to write [default: out.json]
  --ratio <float>    [default: 0.5]
  --wait <duration>  how long to wait [default: 2s]
  --tag <value>      tags to add (repeatable)
  --verbose          say more
  --no-color         use colors [default: true]
  --label <value>    an optional label
  --dry-run          a flag with a dash
  -h, --help         print this help
